{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33657","headline":"苦别离 · 邵谒","name":"苦别离","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"十五爲君婚，二十入君门。\n自从入户後，见君长出门。\n朝看相送人，暮看相送人。\n若遣折杨柳，此地树无根。\n愿爲陌上土，得作马蹄尘。\n愿爲曲木枝，得作双车轮。\n安得太行山，移来君马前。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"邵谒","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33657.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33657","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}